{'symbol': 'RMD', 'date': '2022-08-02 05:00:00', 'title': 'RESMED ACQUIRES LEIPZIG-BASED MEMENTOR WITH\xa0INSOMNIA DIGITAL HEALTH SOLUTION SOMNIO', 'text': 'MARTINSRIED, GERMANY AND LEIPZIG, GERMANY, AUG. 02, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0RESMED (NYSE: RMD, ASX: RMD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ACQUISITION OF LEIPZIG-BASED COMPANY MEMENTOR; THE DEAL WAS COMPLETED MONDAY, AUGUST 1. WITH THIS ACQUISITION, RESMED STRENGTHENS ITS OVERALL SLEEP PORTFOLIO IN GERMANY WITH A DIGITAL SOLUTION FOR INSOMNIA.'}